{{Quote|Can I offer you a libation to celebrate the closing of our shared narrative?''"<br />"''I would be obliged.|The Client offers Greef Karga a drink, before nodding at the droid|audio=ClientKarga-Drink-TMS1C7.flac|<ref name="Chapter 7" />}}
An '''RA-7 protocol droid''' served as a [[bartender]] in a [[cantina]] [[Nevarro school|on]] [[Nevarro]]. When "[[the Client]]" met with [[Greef Karga]], [[Carasynthia Dune|Cara Dune]], and [[Din Djarin]], who was pretending to have been captured by the two, the droid was inside the cantina alongside at least eight [[stormtrooper]] guards. When the three companions sprung their trap, they fired on the stormtroopers and the Client. The droid was [[Death|destroyed]] soon after when [[Moff]] [[Gideon]]'s [[death trooper]]s open fired in the cantina, killing everyone inside except for Djarin, Dune, and Karga, who took cover as Gideon's forces surrounded the building and trapped them inside.<ref name="Chapter 7" />

